# ---- Terraform ----
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
errored.tfstate
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored — it should be committed.

# ---- Secrets / keys / env ----
**/.env
.env
.env.*
# ...but the templates must be committed, or a fresh clone has no list of the
# keys a service needs. They hold placeholder names and no values.
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
*-secrets.json
secrets.json

# ---- Ansible ----
*.retry
infra/ansible/inventories/*/host_vars/*.local.yml

# ---- Editor / tooling ----
.DS_Store
.claude/
.vscode/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
